  "review": [
    "No chorus; one 20-line stanza. Egyptian-colloquial Arabic. The period in 1:3 (أنت الهنا. وعزنا بيك) is rendered as the half-phrase separator ·. الغمر → מְצוּלָה, وجودك → הֲוָיָתְךָ, يمبوع → מַעְיָן per glossary; وادي البكا kept as biblical עֵמֶק הַבָּכָא (Ps 84). Closing אָמֵן pair repeated as in the Arabic."
